title: "PokéQuant: reproducible risk-adjusted analysis of Pokémon TCG booster opening versus direct purchase"
abstract: >-
  Open-source engine and study comparing booster opening with direct
  secondary-market purchase of Pokémon TCG cards, accounting for pull-rate
  uncertainty, value dispersion, fees and liquidity.
